---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="card">
  <div class="icon-wrap"><Icon name="list" /></div>
  <h3>What to do before we arrive</h3>
  <ul class="ticks">
    <li>Power and water connected on the day.</li>
    <li>Everything out, including the last boxes and the fridge.</li>
    <li>Keys, lockbox code or the agent's details sorted.</li>
    <li>Tell us where to park, and any gate code.</li>
    <li>Apartment? Book the service lift, or send us the building manager's contact and we'll do it.</li>
    <li>Any rubbish removed. We don't take rubbish unless it's booked.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
